#: 8cc31abaf3464ef3874f0de5f7f09c76
msgid ""
"In this how-to, we will restrict the clipboard policy to prevent an "
"*untrusted* qube from pasting something in a *vault* qube, **as an example**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/how-to-guides/how-to-edit-a-policy.rst:19
#: 8110544e85cc4407b70f80dea2eefb65
msgid "Edit a policy with :program:`Qubes OS Global Config`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/how-to-guides/how-to-edit-a-policy.rst:21
#: 6b3ccbebe7054987821eda42b5a32353
msgid ""
":program:`Qubes OS Global Config` allows you to edit the most common "
"policies. Following our clipboard example:"
